						<div class="fusion-title title fusion-sep-none fusion-title-center fusion-title-size-one" style="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:30px;"><h1 class="title-heading-center"><h1 style="text-align: center;">U.S. House Democratic Candidate for Arizona&#8217;s 8th District</h1></h1></div><div class="fusion-text"><blockquote>
<p><span style="font-size: 24px;">&#8220;Brianna Westbrook’s life journey from a childhood riddled with poverty and addiction to becoming the working-class woman she is today has prepared her to fight authentically for social and economic justice courageously, and to represent the interests of the working-class people of our nation, not corrupt corporate America.&#8221;</span></p>
</blockquote>
